    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "O'Connell Properties are delighted to bring to the market 134 Kilieran Road, Cabra, Dublin 7. This is a 4 bedroom end of terraced family home with front garden and off street parking. This is a mature private and much sought after location close to many amenities. The accommodation comprises of an entrance hallway, two large living rooms to the front of the house, a W/C, and the kitchen to the rear. Upstairs you will find four bedrooms.\r\n\r\nThis property requires refurbishment however it has the potential to make a fantastic family home in a highly desirable and mature location convenient to numerous city centre bus routes and only 400 metres to the local Luas station. The property is close to the Phoenix Park, and c.4 Kms to Dublin city centre. Very convenient to shops, schools and transport links. There are also numerous social, sporting and recreational clubs/facilities in the local community and an excellent choice of national and secondary schools. There is a vibrant local community with many clubs/societies and sporting facilities within the area. This is a fantastic location on the City end of Cabra and only 1.5km to the Phoenix Park and c.4 Kms to the City Centre.\r\n\r\nThis stunning property has the potential to become ones dream family home and is an opportunity for its new owner to apply their own stamp and lay down roots in a much sought after location in Dublin 7.\r\n\r\nThis is a highly desirable mature residential location convenient to numerous city centre bus routes and walking distance to the local Luas station. The property is convenient to the Phoenix Park and close to shops, schools and transport links. There are also numerous social, sporting and recreational clubs/facilities in the local community and an excellent choice of national and secondary schools.\r\n\r\nAccommodation:\r\nGround floor:\r\nLiving room: 3.9m X 4.2m\r\n\r\nSitting room: 3.9m X 4.41m\r\n\r\nKitchen: 2.60 X 2.46\r\n\r\nFirst floor:\r\nBedroom 1: 3.95m X 4.22m\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: 3.34m X 4m \r\n\r\nBedroom 3: 2.65m X 2.24m\r\n\r\nBedroom 4: 3.52m X 2.6m\r\n\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\nQualifies for the vacant property grant - Subject to application\r\nRequires refurbishment\r\nOpportunity to create your dream home\r\nFront garden and Large, bright and sunny back garden.\r\nFantastic and much sought after location next to the Luas station, close to the wonderful Phoenix Park and Dublin City Centre\r\nExcellent choice of local national and secondary schools\r\nVibrant local community with many sporting and recreational clubs/facilities available in the local community\r\n\r\n\"Whilst every care has been taken in the preparation of these particulars, and they are believed to be correct, they are not warranted and intended purchasers/lessees should satisfy themselves as to the correctness of the information given\"."
